  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div> <p><span>FEATURES</span></p><h2>Everything you need to<br><span>stay on the cutting edge</span></h2> <p>From personalized discovery to AI-powered understanding — Papel transforms how you interact with academic research.</p> </div><div> <!-- Feature 1: Feed --> <div> <div> <p><span>DISCOVERY</span></p><h3>A feed that knows<br>what you're researching</h3> <p>Papers ranked by your interests, trending topics, freshness, and community engagement. Choose a feed mode in Settings when you want Latest instead of recommendations.</p> <ul> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>Vector-similarity powered recommendations</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>Full-screen immersive paper cards</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>Never see the same paper twice</li> </ul> </div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://andreaturchet.github.io/website/assets/screenshot-feed.png\" alt=\"Papel feed\" width=\"400\" height=\"867\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </p> </div> </div> <!-- Feature 2: AI Chat --> <div> <div> <p><span>AI CHAT</span></p><h3>Talk to any paper.<br>Get instant answers.</h3> <p>Ask questions about any paper and get grounded answers from the full PDF — powered entirely on-device using Apple Intelligence or local MLX models.</p> <ul> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>RAG pipeline over full PDF text</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>100% on-device — your data never leaves</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>Apple Intelligence or local MLX backend</li> </ul> </div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://andreaturchet.github.io/website/assets/screenshot-chat-paper.png\" alt=\"Chatting with a paper in Papel\" width=\"472\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </p> </div> </div> <!-- Feature 3: Quiz --> <div> <div> <p><span>GAMIFICATION</span></p><h3>Test your knowledge.<br>Earn XP. Level up.</h3> <p>AI-generated quizzes on every paper. Score perfectly to earn +50 XP, maintain streaks, and climb the academic ranks from Undergrad to Nobel Laureate.</p> <ul> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>3-question quizzes per paper</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>XP, streaks &amp; academic ranks</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>Master papers to track expertise</li> </ul> </div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://andreaturchet.github.io/website/assets/screenshot-quiz-paper.png\" alt=\"Knowledge quiz in Papel\" width=\"472\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </p> </div> </div> <!-- Feature 4: Social --> <div> <div> <p><span>COMMUNITY</span></p><h3>Connect with<br>fellow researchers</h3> <p>Like and comment on papers, share discoveries with colleagues via direct messages, and build your academic profile in a community that values knowledge.</p> <ul> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>Likes, comments &amp; shares</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>Direct messages between researchers</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline> </svg>Academic profile &amp; rank badges</li> </ul> </div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://andreaturchet.github.io/website/assets/screenshot-comments.png\" alt=\"Comments in Papel\" width=\"400\" height=\"867\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </p> </div> </div> </div></div>",
